cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "Polymarket ILS Corpus"
abstract: >-
  Population-scale Information Leakage Score (ILS) computations for 4,801
  resolved Polymarket markets. Each record provides ILS anchored at
  t_resolve - 24h (structural proxy for 4,796 markets) or at a recovered
  T_event (5 markets), multi-window pre-anchor variants (30min, 2h, 6h,
  24h, 7d), top-wallet concentration (HHI), and operational scope-condition
  flags. Includes an anchor_type column that clearly distinguishes proxy-
  anchored from event-anchored records.
type: dataset
